		{
			"speaker_name": "Tom",
			"text": "你好。\n又见面了。",
			"unlock_key": "",
			"background": "res://TextureAsset/Level1/Tom/tom_loan_02_counter.png"
		},
		{
			"speaker_name": "Me",
			"speaker_role": "player",
			"text": "你来了。\n这次还是时间贷款？",
			"unlock_key": ""
		},
		{
			"speaker_name": "Tom",
			"text": "是的，我之后应该不会再来了，我决定离开这个地方。",
			"unlock_key": ""
		},
		{
			"speaker_name": "Me",
			"speaker_role": "player",
			"text": "（沉默了一会儿）……",
			"unlock_key": ""
		},
		{
			"speaker_name": "Me",
			"speaker_role": "player",
			"text": "好，申请多少？",
			"unlock_key": ""
		},
		{
			"speaker_name": "Tom",
			"text": "一年。",
			"unlock_key": ""
		},
		{
			"speaker_name": "Me",
			"speaker_role": "player",
			"text": "既然决定离开了，为什么还继续帮助别人？",
			"unlock_key": ""
		},
		{
			"speaker_name": "Tom",
			"text": "最后一次了，顺便和你告个别。",
			"unlock_key": ""
		},
		{
			"speaker_name": "Me",
			"speaker_role": "player",
			"text": "祝你拥有崭新的生活。",
			"unlock_key": ""
		},
		{
			"speaker_name": "Tom",
			"text": "谢谢。",
			"unlock_key": ""
		},
		{
			"speaker_name": "Tom",
			"text": "（递交资料）这我们最后一次见面了，这次就走个形式吧。",
